From 1c9cbc784f76d9cbf1e112c2855be625d41ed467 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:47:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/37] bitproxy: sing-box config generator with golden tests

Builds the config that reference/conf-merger.py produced: one wireguard
endpoint per server, VPN selector, per-app/clone selectors routed by
user_id, hijack-dns, remote DNS through the VPN. On top of the script:
TUN address always follows the selected server (servers with another
tunnel address are left out and reported), DNS/broadcast check for the
/24, only VPN-mode apps use remote DNS, unique outbound tags, and the
automatic IPv6 mode. Golden tests compare against the script's real
output (golden/regenerate.sh).
